WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.252
Long article, busy hands? Try listening with Web Reader

2
00:00:03.252 --> 00:00:06.504
for Android.

3
00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:10.850
Open an article in your browser. Tap Share and choose

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.197
Web Reader. Or copy the link and paste it into the app.

5
00:00:15.197 --> 00:00:18.853
Wait for the article text, then start playback. Choose a

6
00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:22.508
comfortable speed. You can switch apps and control

7
00:00:22.508 --> 00:00:26.164
playback from your notification.

8
00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:29.621
Want to return to a page? Find recently opened pages

9
00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:33.078
in your Web Reader library.

10
00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:37.380
Results vary by website, and voices depend on your

11
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:41.683
device. Get Web Reader on Google Play. If a page does

12
00:00:41.683 --> 00:00:45.986
not read correctly, send feedback so I can investigate.

